# secrets
# GOTCHA: .gitignore has NO inline comments. `*.key  # private` matches nothing —
# it becomes the literal pattern "*.key  # private". Comments go on their own line.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
.env
.env.*
credentials
*.secret

